2) Aur kuch maximum ya minimum nikalna hoga + Sum/Product/Frequency + Optional: koi condition di ho sakti hai jaise ek delete kar sakte hai ya array circular hoga. Aur ye saari chije subarray mein, Subsequence mein nhi.

